<title>INDIA: India ITC shrs up on good Q1 reports.</title>
<headline>India ITC shrs up on good Q1 reports.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Indian tobacoo major ITC Ltd jumped 17.50 rupees, or 3.70 percent, to 489.75 at the Bombay bourse on Thursday on reports that the firm has notched a sharp rise in its first quarter net profit, traders said.</p>
